tTrigger.of(1)))` — no, that's not right either.\n\nLet me use a different strategy. I'll skip the session window entirely and use a `KeyedProcessFunction` directly on the SUBMIT events, where I use event-time timers to detect session gaps:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5077,"cache_read_input_tokens":70209,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5077,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1}},"requestId":"req_vrtx_011CXt8urpy8Gh6LbxipAbQE","type":"assistant","uuid":"a6e09096-2584-4f60-a6d8-b1b80ee3ed2c","timestamp":"2026-02-07T05:14:01.396Z"}
